  "description": "A graph manipulation library for .NET: directed/undirected, weighted (generic math), multigraphs, DAG-enforcing and dense matrix-backed graphs, plus hypergraphs — with traversals, cycle detection, topological sort, connectivity/SCC, shortest paths (Dijkstra, Bellman-Ford, Floyd-Warshall, A*), minimum spanning trees (Kruskal, Prim), and structural queries.",
